data.content:
Okuva mu baana ba Yusufu:
    mu kya Efulayimu ye Erisaama mutabani wa Ammikudi;
    mu kya Manase ye Gamalyeri mutabani wa Pedazuuli.

Abayiiya ennyimba kyebaava bayimba nti,
  “Mujje e Kesuboni kizimbibwe;
    ekibuga kya Sikoni kizzibwewo.

Bw’atyo n’alagula nti,
  “Golokoka, Balaki, owulirize;
    mpulira, mutabani wa Zipoli.

“Mmulaba, naye si kaakano;
    mmutunuulira, naye tali kumpi.
  Emmunyeenye eriva ewa Yakobo;
    omufuzi alisituka ng’ava mu Isirayiri.
  Alibetenta Mowaabu,
    obuwanga bw’abatabani ba Seezi.

Edomu aliwangulwa;
    Seyiri, omulabe we, aliwangulwa,
    naye Isirayiri alyeyongera amaanyi.

Ebyombo birijja nga biva ku mbalama za Kittimu;
  birifufuggaza Asuli ne Eberi,
    naye nabyo birizikirira.”

Ab’omu kika kya Simyoni ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali be bano:
    abaava mu Nemweri, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abanemweri;
    abaava mu Yamini, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abayamini;
    abaava mu Yakini, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abayakini;

Ab’omu kika kya Gaadi ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali, be bano:
    abaava mu Zefoni, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abazefoni;
    abaava mu Kagi, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abakagi;
    abaava mu Suni, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abasuni;

Ab’omu kika kya Yuda ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali, be bano:
    abaava mu Seera, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abaseera;
    abaava mu Pereezi, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abapereezi;
    abaava mu Zeera, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abazeera.

Ab’omu kika kya Isakaali ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali, be bano:
    abaava mu Tola, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abatola;
    abaava mu Puva, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abapuva;

Ab’omu kika kya Zebbulooni ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali be bano:
    abaava mu Seredi, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abaseredi;
    abaava mu Eroni, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abaeroni;
    abaava mu Yaleeri, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abayaleeri.

Ab’omu kika kya Gireyaadi ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali be bano:
    abaava mu Yezeeri, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abayezeeri,
    abaava mu Kereki, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abakereki;

Ab’omu kika kya Efulayimu ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali, be bano:
    abaava mu Susera, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abasusera;
    abaava mu Bekeri, lwe lunyiriri lw’Ababekeri;
    abaava mu Takani, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abatakani.

Abazzukulu ba Bera nga bava mu Aluda ne Naamani ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali be bano:
    abaava mu Aluda, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abaluda;
    abaava mu Naamani, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abanaamani.

Ab’omu kika kya Aseri ng’ennyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali be bano:
    abaava mu Imuna, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abayimuna;
    abaava mu Isuvi, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abayisuvi;
    abaava mu Beriya, lwe lunyiriri lw’Ababeriya.

Ate okuva mu bazzukulu ba Beriya, ze zino:
    abaava mu Keberi, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abakeberi;
    abaava mu Malukiyeeri, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abamalukiyeeri.

Bano be Baleevi abaabalibwa ng’enyiriri zaabwe bwe zaali:
    abaava mu Gerusoni, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abagerusoni;
    abaava mu Kokasi, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abakokasi;
    abaava mu Merali, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abamerali.

Ab’omu kika kya Lewubeeni, mutabani wa Isirayiri omubereberye, be bano:
    abaava mu Kanoki, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abakanoki;
    abaava mu Palu, lwe lunyiriri lw’Abapalu;
